[N 30-31 Loose Ends: Stormwind, Duskwood and Arathi]
[D Forever Warrior 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Hand-ins for chains started in chapters 18-23, the Missing Diplomat across Stormwind and Duskwood, Morbent Fel and Mor'Ladim at Raven Hill and an optional Lakeshire stop, ending at the Stormwind harbour.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 30|r  -  you are in Ironforge with Gnomeregan done; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there. This chapter closes loops: about 25,000 quest XP with everything (28,000 with Lakeshire) from hand-ins, the Missing Diplomat chain and two Duskwood elites that need a healer and a third (about 8,500 of it). Level-30 abilities were trained last chapter and level 32 is not due yet; the Old Town stop below is only a check.
[OC]|cffffcc00Carry in:|r Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators (2928, finished in Gnomeregan), Blessed Arm (322), Return to Milton (542, only if you took the Durnholde group quest), Reassignment (563) and, for the Lakeshire option, Fallen in the Fen (95795). The Stormwind ones hand in within ten minutes of the tram.
Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind [G76.5,51.5 Ironforge]

[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r  -  one loop from the tram: Cathedral Square, the Dwarven District, the Keep, the south-east corner and the Trade District. The Missing Diplomat is a long chain (twelve parts to Menethil, then it runs on to Dustwallow Marsh); the first nine parts, about 5,400 XP, are done here and in Duskwood and every one of them requires level 28.
