[OC]|cffffffffDuskwood|r  -  Darkshire, the Defias camp in the south-west, then Sven's camp and Raven Hill in the north-west, then Darkshire and Raven Hill again: the Mor'Ladim chain bounces three times because Sirra, Althea and Sarah Ladimore are in Darkshire while the kill and the grave are at Raven Hill (about 55 units each way). The |cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r lines are optional; without a healer and a third do Armed and Ready and the Docket only and skip about 8,500 XP.
