[OC]|cffffcc00The Docket:|r the Defias Strongbox stands in a Defias camp in the south-west: Night Blades (25-26) and Enchanters (26-27) on the box, Night Runners (24-25) a couple of units off, no elite in the DB. |cff66ff66normal|r (one click), but pull them in ones and twos. Run north to Sven afterwards
