[OC]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r |cffffcc00Mor'Ladim|r is a level 35 elite skeleton (~3,660 HP in the Classic DB) who patrols the cemetery with a wide aggro radius. Classic sources: Enraging Memories (a frenzy: double attack speed for 8 seconds, he moves 25% slower and hits 10 points softer) and Holy Shock; unverified on Forever. The cemetery is packed with 26-29 undead, so pull him away from the others and tank him alone in Defensive Stance, Shield Block through the frenzy
[O]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r Kill [TAR522 Mor'Ladim] on his patrol and loot Mor'Ladim's Skull [QC228] [G16.7,37.4 Duskwood]
