[OC]|cffffffffPointers for later|r  -  none of these is routed in this guide
[OC]|cffffcc00Refuge Pointe:|r about 30,500 XP of level-30 quests. Captain Nials (45.8,47.6) gives Northfold Manor (681, 2,500 XP: 10 Syndicate Highwaymen and 6 Mercenaries at 29-35, 24-33) and the Wanted Board holds Marez Cowl (684) and Otto and Falconcrest (685), 3,750-3,900 XP each, group. Malin's Request (690) starts with Archmage Malin in Stormwind's Mage Quarter (50.5,87.5) and bounces to Skuerto at Refuge Pointe: 1,950 XP now and 3,750 XP at the end (697)
[OC]|cffffcc00City of Dalaran:|r the run is in the 30-40 guide. Its three lead-ins are already in your log: A Green Sample 92456 and Power Overwhelming 92489 (Stormwind, chapter 15) and An Alarming Request 92432 (Southshore, chapter 23). Only the two Modera quests remain to pick up, Starving Arcane 92457 and Heart of Disruption 92458, from the Image of Archmage Modera on the Silverpine shore of Lordamere (68.6,45.2), where 92432 hands in. The entrance is in the Alterac Mountains (8.5,59.2)
[OC]|cffffcc00Scarlet Monastery:|r Mythology of the Titans (1050, 3,550 XP, requires level 28) from Librarian Mae Paledust in Ironforge (75.0,12.5); the book is an object inside the Monastery (the Library wing in Classic; entrance Tirisfal Glades 82.6,33.8, Horde country). The Fury Runs Deep (378): if you still hold it from chapter 19, Kam Deepfury needs a second Stockade run and hands in at Motley Garmason in Dun Modr
[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r still open on purpose: The Missing Diplomat 1248 (Mikhail at Menethil Harbor, 10.6,60.8: 660 XP, then Tapoke Jahn 1249 for 1,300 XP and 1250 for 265 XP; after that the chain leaves for Dustwallow Marsh by the Theramore boat, a trip for level 30+. Hand it in whenever you pass Menethil, otherwise abandon it [QS1248]); the three City of Dalaran lead-ins (92456, 92489, 92432), carried into the 30-40 guide. Next: the Stormwind harbour boat for Razorfen Kraul
